@startuml CU-17
actor "Encargado de sucursal" as Stf
actor "Cliente (con reserva)" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (gestión de reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reservations, /sales" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReservationService / SalesService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> Stf : 1: presenta su código de recogida
Stf -> UI : 2: verificar reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 3: GET /reservations/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : 4: get(db, reservation_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 5: ReservationRead (pickup_code, estado)
Ctrl --> UI : 6: verificación de reserva
UI --> Stf : 7: reserva verificada

Stf -> UI : 8: registrar recepción / preparar atención
UI -> Ctrl : 9: PATCH /reservations/{id}/status
Ctrl -> Model : 10: transition(PENDING → PREPARED)
Model --> Ctrl : 11: reserva PREPARED
Ctrl --> UI : 12: ReservationRead
UI --> Stf : 13: atención iniciada (prendas preparadas)

Stf -> UI : 14: cliente en atención (prueba)
UI -> Ctrl : 15: PATCH /reservations/{id}/status
Ctrl -> Model : 16: transition(PREPARED → IN_TRIAL)
Model --> Ctrl : 17: reserva IN_TRIAL
Ctrl --> UI : 18: ReservationRead

Stf -> UI : 19: concluir la atención
UI -> Ctrl : 20: POST /sales {reservation_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 21: create_sale(db, reservation)
Model --> Ctrl : 22: reserva COMPLETED + Sale
Ctrl --> UI : 23: SaleRead
UI --> Stf : 24: reserva atendida

@enduml